---
name: quality-report
version: 1.1.0
description: Final QA closeout report template for PASS verdicts.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - qa_pass
  - sprint_id
  - task_id
  - branch
  - commit
  - pr_number
  - verdict
  - validated_scope_md
  - findings_blocking
  - findings_important
  - findings_minor
  - residual_risks_md
  - merge_readiness
  - merge_reason
  - recommendation
optional_variables:
  - blocking_ids_json
  - reviewer_spawn_gate
  - reviewer_manifest_json
  - evidence_chain_json
defaults:
  blocking_ids_json: "[]"
  reviewer_spawn_gate: ""
  reviewer_manifest_json: ""
  evidence_chain_json: ""
metadata:
  type: qa-quality-report
  tags:
    - stage:qa
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: sprint
      variable: sprint_id
    state: qa-approved
    stage: qa
    transition: approved
    iteration_variable: qa_pass
---
# Final Quality Report

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
QA Pass: {{ qa_pass }}
Sprint/Task: {{ sprint_id }} / {{ task_id }}
Branch: `{{ branch }}`
Commit: `{{ commit }}`
PR: #{{ pr_number }}
Final Verdict: **{{ verdict }}**

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "sprint": {{ sprint_id | tojson }},
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
  "commit": {{ commit | tojson }},
  "pr": {{ pr_number }},
  "verdict": {{ verdict | tojson }},
  "findings": {
    "blocking": {{ findings_blocking }},
    "important": {{ findings_important }},
    "minor": {{ findings_minor }}
  },
  "blocking_ids": {{ blocking_ids_json | safe }},
  "merge_readiness": {{ merge_readiness | tojson }},
  "merge_reason": {{ merge_reason | tojson }},
  "next_action": "none",
  "owner": "none",
  "recommendation": {{ recommendation | tojson }}
{%- if reviewer_spawn_gate %},
  "reviewer_spawn_gate": {{ reviewer_spawn_gate | tojson }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if reviewer_manifest_json %},
  "reviewer_manifest": {{ reviewer_manifest_json | safe }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if evidence_chain_json %},
  "evidence_chain": {{ evidence_chain_json | safe }}
{%- endif +%}
}
```

## Validated Scope
{% if validated_scope_md -%}
{{ validated_scope_md }}
{% else -%}
- not specified
{% endif %}

## Findings Summary (Final)
- Blocking: {{ findings_blocking }}
- Important: {{ findings_important }}
- Minor: {{ findings_minor }}

## Residual Risks
{% if residual_risks_md -%}
{{ residual_risks_md }}
{% else -%}
- none
{% endif %}

## Merge Readiness
- Status: **{{ merge_readiness }}**
- Reason: {{ merge_reason }}

## Recommendation
{{ recommendation }}
{% if reviewer_spawn_gate +%}
## Reviewer Spawn Gate
- Gate: **{{ reviewer_spawn_gate }}**
- Reviewer manifest and evidence chain are in the Machine Status JSON above.
{% endif %}
